        "uri": "https://github.com/traefik/traefik/blob/v3.0.0/docs/content/migration/v2-to-v3.md",
        "locator": "L392-L416 (Migration Guide: From v2 to v3 › Static configuration › Marathon provider)",
        "excerpt": "### Marathon provider\n\nMarathon maintenance [ended on October 31, 2021](https://github.com/mesosphere/marathon/blob/master/README.md).\nIn v3, the Marathon provider has been removed.\n\n??? example \"An example of v2 Marathon provider configuration\"\n\n    ```yaml tab=\"File (YAML)\"\n    providers:\n      marathon: {}\n    ```\n\n    ```toml tab=\"File (TOML)\"\n    [providers.marathon]\n    ```\n\n    ```bash tab=\"CLI\"\n    --providers.marathon=true\n    ```\n\nThis configuration is now unsupported and would prevent Traefik to start.\n\n#### Remediation\n\nAll Marathon provider related configuration should be removed …",
